TITLE Ca speciation with calcite+gypsum+aragonite and mixed gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file ca_sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Ca_species_count
    10 cnt = 0
    20 FOR i = 1 TO TOT("Ca")
    30   s$ = SPECIES_NAME$("Ca", i)
    40   IF (MOL(s$) > 0) THEN cnt = cnt + 1
    50 NEXT i
    60 PUNCH cnt
END
